{
  "name": "Slack Sprint Retrospective Bot",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "sprint-end",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Sprint End Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [260, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst data = items[0].json;\nconst sprintName = data.sprintName || `Sprint ${Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000)}`;\nconst channel = data.channel || '#engineering';\nconst retroId = `retro-${Date.now()}`;\n\nreturn [{json: {\n  sprintName,\n  channel,\n  retroId,\n  startedAt: new Date().toISOString()\n}}];"
      },
      "name": "Prepare Retro",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [480, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $json.channel }}",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": ":recycle: *Sprint Retrospective — {{ $json.sprintName }}*\n\nPlease share your thoughts in threads below! :point_down:\n\n*Retro ID:* {{ $json.retroId }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "name": "Post Retro Header",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [700, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('Prepare Retro').item.json.channel }}",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": ":white_check_mark: *What went well?*\n\nReply in thread with things that worked great this sprint!",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "name": "Post Went Well",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [920, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('Prepare Retro').item.json.channel }}",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": ":construction: *What could be improved?*\n\nReply in thread with areas for improvement!",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "name": "Post Improve",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [920, 340],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('Prepare Retro').item.json.channel }}",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": ":dart: *Action items for next sprint*\n\nReply in thread with specific actions we should take!",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "name": "Post Actions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [920, 480],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "retro-collect",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Collect Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [260, 600]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Retrospectives",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Sheets Compile",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [480, 600],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Slack Sprint Retrospective Bot\n\nStructured sprint retro collection.\n\n**Retro Flow:**\n1. Jira/webhook triggers sprint end\n2. Post retro header message\n3. Post three category prompts:\n   - What went well\n   - What to improve\n   - Action items\n4. Collect threaded responses\n5. Compile to Google Sheets\n\n**Webhook payload:**\n```json\n{\n  \"sprintName\": \"Sprint 42\",\n  \"channel\": \"#engineering\"\n}\n```",
        "width": 340,
        "height": 340
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [20, 220]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Sprint End Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Prepare Retro",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Prepare Retro": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post Retro Header",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Post Retro Header": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post Went Well",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Post Improve",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Post Actions",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Collect Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Sheets Compile",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}